  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut sweet potato into fries.<br>• Place on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat.<br>• Bake until tender, 20-25 minutes.<br>TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide fries between two trays. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a46016dd3d3e0dadd377a74/step-c94e9500.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• When fries have 15 minutes remaining, place mozzarella cauliflower bites on a <br>second lined oven tray.<br>• Bake until browned and heated through, 10-15 minutes. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a46016dd3d3e0dadd377a74/step-89591a10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• While mozzarella bites are baking, roughly chop cucumber and halve snacking <br>tomatoes.<br>• In a medium bowl, combine gourmet leaf mix, cucumber, tomatoes and a <br>drizzle of olive oil and vinegar. Season to taste with salt and pepper. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a46016dd3d3e0dadd377a74/step-d1553720.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide sweet potato fries, mozzarella-cauli bites and garden salad between bowls.<br>• Serve with dill &amp; parsley mayonnaise and chilli jam. Enjoy!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a46016dd3d3e0dadd377a74/step-ebd6a130.jpg"
    }
  ]
